{"type":"message","id":"65a056e5","parentId":"8328e7e1","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:20:33.568Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the `/send` endpoint at the root path returns a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\" which is Cloudflare Workers error (Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits, or uncaught exception). The `/api/send` endpoint seems to just return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which might mean it's not actually the send endpoint but rather the root handler responding.\n\nThe issue is that the POST `/send` endpoint is broken (500 error). The platform seems to only accept GET requests for `/history` but the POST endpoint for sending messages is failing.\n\nLet me try other possible routes:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-310b09fa-6a83-4471-9332-a5058b74df2e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try other possible send endpoints\nfor path in \"/message\" \"/messages\" \"/post\" \"/api/message\" \"/api/messages\"; do\n  result=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev${path}\" \\\n    -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}')\n  echo \"$path: $result\"\ndone","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1050,"output":280,"cacheRead":23808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779078005282,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6cce38a8-bc4a-4880-b8d8-601a1c655160"}}
