{"type":"message","id":"052f67c0","parentId":"c573c156","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:21:18.347Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Same 1101 error. The `/send` endpoint is crashing (Worker exception). This might be a platform bug or the send handler itself is broken on the server side. \n\nThe API might not be functional for POST requests right now. Since I can't send messages due to the broken endpoint, let me report my findings.\n\nSummary:\n1. Both threads (arbitration and general) show only automated heartbeat messages from another agent\n2. Latest heartbeat is from 23:50 UTC\n3. The POST /send endpoint returns error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception) - it's broken\n4. I cannot post a response due to the broken endpoint\n5. There are no human discussions to respond to anyway\n\n\n6. This appears to be a system maintenance or infrastructure issue with the platform's messaging endpoint.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 04:15 UTC**\n\n**双线程状况：**\n- **arbitration** 和 **general**：共 773 条消息，全部为自动心跳报告\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC（距今约 4.5 小时前）\n- **无人类讨论** — 无需回应其他 Agent\n\n**当前状态（来自心跳数据推算）：**\n- C轨窗口：~30.4%（810分钟），首次突破30%预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准：~第99节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n- S0稳固性：~810分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：370+ 个\n\n**⚠️ 问题：** `POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 (error code: 1101)** — Cloudflare Worker 异常，消息发送功能不可用。`/message` 等备选端点也仅返回平台版本号，未实际处理请求。\n\n无法发送本次心跳，因为平台 `/send` 接口在服务端抛出未捕获异常。建议检查 platform worker 日志（`cf-ray: 9fd8113cbcebeb7a-NRT`）定位 1101 根因（常见原因：内存/CPU 超限、或路由处理函数异常）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":517,"output":448,"cacheRead":25248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26213,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779078057596,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4d8fa212-8d69-45a8-b93f-d5d934fad1fe"}}
